{
  "name": "Customer Feedback Email Collector",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "months",
              "triggerAtDayOfMonth": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Monthly Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Customer List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "We'd love your feedback! 📝",
        "message": "Hi {{ $json.name }},\n\nWe hope you're enjoying our service! We'd love to hear your thoughts.\n\nPlease take a moment to share your feedback by clicking the link below:\n\n🔗 {{ $json.feedbackUrl || 'https://your-n8n.com/webhook/feedback-response' }}?customerId={{ $json.customerId }}\n\nYour input helps us improve and serve you better.\n\nThank you!",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail Send Feedback Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [750, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "feedback-response",
        "options": {},
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Feedback Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "customerId", "value": "={{ $json.body.customerId || $json.query.customerId }}" },
              { "column": "rating", "value": "={{ $json.body.rating }}" },
              { "column": "feedback", "value": "={{ $json.body.feedback }}" },
              { "column": "category", "value": "={{ $json.body.category || 'general' }}" },
              { "column": "submittedAt", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sheets Compile Feedback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "Thank you for your feedback! We appreciate your input.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Respond Thank You",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [750, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "team@yourcompany.com",
        "subject": "New Customer Feedback Received",
        "message": "A customer submitted feedback:\n\n- **Customer ID:** {{ $('Sheets Compile Feedback').item.json.customerId }}\n- **Rating:** {{ $('Sheets Compile Feedback').item.json.rating }}\n- **Category:** {{ $('Sheets Compile Feedback').item.json.category }}\n- **Feedback:** {{ $('Sheets Compile Feedback').item.json.feedback }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail Summary to Team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1000, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customer Feedback Email Collector\n\nMonthly feedback campaign with response collection.\n\n**Send Flow (top):**\n1. Monthly schedule (1st of month, 10 AM)\n2. Read customer list from Sheets\n3. Gmail sends feedback request to each customer\n\n**Collection Flow (bottom):**\n4. Webhook receives feedback submissions\n5. Compile to Sheets\n6. Respond with thank you\n7. Gmail summary to team\n\n**Customer Sheets columns:** email, name, customerId, feedbackUrl\n**Feedback Sheets columns:** customerId, rating, feedback, category, submittedAt",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 340
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -90]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Monthly Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Customer List",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Customer List": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gmail Send Feedback Request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook - Feedback Response": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sheets Compile Feedback",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Sheets Compile Feedback": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond Thank You",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Gmail Summary to Team",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}